Subject: [PATCH] ole32: data cache IViewObject::GetColorSet (patch 5111)

The palette of a cached DIB or metafile; gap-CORE item 509. Gate with two mutants.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
